    {
      "author": "AI Sims project",
      "url": "assets/release/ui/story_locations.png",
      "description": "Three scenario covers in one 2172 x 724 atlas: concrete institutional yard, warm residential market, prefabricated research campus.",
      "kind": "generated",
      "tool": "OpenAI ImageGen (built-in)",
      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Single panoramic chapter-choice illustration triptych for AI Sims, a grounded social simulation. Three equal-width panels edge to edge, no gaps and no border. Architectural visualization with softly bevelled everyday objects, believable materials and balanced colors, like an art-directed handcrafted 3D environment in realistic stylization. Each panel is independently framed with its main landmark in the middle, clear at thumbnail size. Left panel: concrete institutional enclosure, fenced rectangular common yard, faded petrol-blue metal, ration office with plain service hatch, overcast late morning, amber entry lights. Center panel: dense lived-in residential courtyard with muted terracotta brick and cream plaster, shade awnings, young ornamental trees, open market and a shared path, afternoon sun. Right panel: isolated research station, slate-steel prefabricated three-module campus, pale gravel, ribs, narrow windows, and amber guide markings toward the airlock, cold exterior afternoon light and warm windows. All in the same slightly elevated architectural camera, editorial games art, restrained grain, subtle ambient shadows, grounded material scale and sense of lived-in places. Design as a very wide 3:1 overall triptych, with each landmark composed for a square center crop. No text at all, no signage lettering, no logo, no people, no UI, no watermark, no printed frames, no neon cyberpunk."
    }
  ],
